{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are also tired of the pattern of brushing to eliminate the specified number, you can experience the game of solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different from the general three-elimination game, this game is to clear all icons on the screen, and will not be added in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to observe and plan the order of elimination, which may be eliminated in one step, which is a trap buried. If there are four similar targets, the four targets should be eliminated together. If you are eager to operate, you will fall into the &quot;trap&quot; prepared for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >point out</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least three horizontal and vertical connections are the same, which can be eliminated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When there is no drop, a single line/column can eliminate five together.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the delay of vertical falling, when the vertical falling reaches the elimination conditions (three), the elimination will be triggered immediately without waiting for the subsequent falling.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981140?t=1758613961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981140/1718499aacba9a843f057bae70bea43b977b32ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758613961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981140/b3d1b9063be355b985867ead654b0f78f1e69210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758613961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981140/b3d1b9063be355b985867ead654b0f78f1e69210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758613961","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are also tired of the pattern of brushing to eliminate the specified number, you can experience the game of solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different from the general three-elimination game, this game is to clear all icons on the screen, and will not be added in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to observe and plan the order of elimination, which may be eliminated in one step, which is a trap buried. If there are four similar targets, the four targets should be eliminated together. If you are eager to operate, you will fall into the &quot;trap&quot; prepared for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >point out</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least three horizontal and vertical connections are the same, which can be eliminated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When there is no drop, a single line/column can eliminate five together.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the delay of vertical falling, when the vertical falling reaches the elimination conditions (three), the elimination will be triggered immediately without waiting for the subsequent falling.</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u7bb1\u76d2"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981140/28745f9a934cd2b2d7a3a7a05e42530bb7db55c7/header.jpg?t=1758613961","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Without authorization, it is forbidden for any unit or individual to use, copy, spread and modify in any form.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul